# RadialClean_v11

Built-in image generation. Preview candidate, not catalog approved.

Art: Lock RadialDirection_v10 layout, crowns and directional fades. Restore RadialCalm_v09 broad middle-gray depth. Replace drawn outlines with broad filled bright white planes meeting sky directly. No narrow rim, scalloped strokes or dark border bands. Preserve exact geometry for coverage registration.

Coverage: Clean existing v10 coverage. Remove isolated specks, thin detached lines, double contours and background residue. Keep major banks, crisp inward crowns and broad side/underside gradients. Solid white bodies, pure black empty sky, no internal shading.

Packing: Independent generated mask; bilinear non-ringing resampling to 4096 square. Original generation 1254 square, upscaled, not native 4K. Previous assets preserved.

Final material change: smoothstep(0.025,0.975,alpha) for both cloud layers before shading and celestial holdout, consistently in sky and independent composite materials. This removes low-level coverage residue. Original backdrop compositing restored after investigation; CloudCompositeBlend remains zero. Material compilation passed.
